NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers the contents of this repository only: the
Dockerfile, scripts, compose file and documentation.

It does NOT cover what a build of this repository produces. An image built
from these instructions contains:

  * NVIDIA CUDA and cuDNN runtime libraries, governed by the CUDA Toolkit EULA
    and the NVIDIA cuDNN Software Licence Agreement.
  * Immich, which is licensed AGPL-3.0.

Building the image for your own use is permitted under the NVIDIA terms you
accepted when installing JetPack. Redistributing the built image is not --
see the "Why there is no image to pull" section of README.md.
